the player to key characters in the game and the main types of tasks that need to be completed to progress through the game.","type":"text","version":1}],"format":"left","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"At the beginning, contacts are only available with Therapist and Scav. After completing their small tasks, you will gradually gain access to Snowflake, Mechanic, Prapor, and Peacekeeper, in that order.","type":"text","version":1}],"format":"left","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"type":"block","version":2,"format":"","fields":{"id":"2d42f851-becc-477a-93cb-bc500a08ce0c","slider":[{"id":"692afe9f8bf1dc08e88a355c","image":{"id":7,"alt":"tur-5","_objectKey":null,"updatedAt":"2025-11-28T14:04:11.797Z","createdAt":"2025-11-28T14:04:11.797Z","url":"/api/media/file/tur-5","thumbnailURL":"/api/media/file/tur-5?preset=sm","filename":"tur-5","mimeType":"application/octet-stream","filesize":260646,"width":null,"height":null},"caption":"Shoreline map with watch tower and Terminal"},{"id":"692afe9f8bf1dc08e88a355d","image":{"id":13,"alt":"tur-6","_objectKey":null,"updatedAt":"2025-11-28T14:04:12.026Z","createdAt":"2025-11-28T14:04:12.026Z","url":"/api/media/file/tur-6","thumbnailURL":"/api/media/file/tur-6?preset=sm","filename":"tur-6","mimeType":"application/octet-stream","filesize":377404,"width":null,"height":null},"caption":"Terminal"},{"id":"692afe9f8bf1dc08e88a355e","image":{"id":14,"alt":"tur-7","_objectKey":null,"updatedAt":"2025-11-28T14:04:12.115Z","createdAt":"2025-11-28T14:04:12.115Z","url":"/api/media/file/tur-7","thumbnailURL":"/api/media/file/tur-7?preset=sm","filename":"tur-7","mimeType":"application/octet-stream","filesize":394384,"width":null,"height":null},"caption":"Watch tower Intercom"}],"blockType":"slider"}},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"The task \"Find the entrance to the Port Terminal\" is considered complete when approaching the Customs - 11 checkpoint on the Shoreline location.","type":"text","version":1}],"format":"left","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Approach with caution, as the machine gunners on the towers around the Terminal are hostile towards players and will open fire if you enter their line of sight. To find the radio for communication with the military, go from the \"Road to Customs\" exit towards the Terminal. The radio will be under the tower.","type":"text","version":1}],"format":"left","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Find Watchtower on the map","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":null,"format":"","indent":0,"type":"link","version":3,"fields":{"doc":{"label":"The Watchtower near the checkpoint","relationTo":"mapPoints","value":{"id":38,"map":{"id":1,"normalizedName":"shoreline","name":"Shoreline","description":null,"image":null,"svgPath":null,"points":[],"updatedAt":"2025-12-27T14:08:10.862Z","createdAt":"2025-11-25T20:09:05.279Z"},"title":"The Watchtower near the checkpoint","slug":"dozornaya-bashnya-u-kpp","routeSlug":"dozornaya-bashnya-u-kpp-38","description":null,"type":"objective","images":null,"position":{"x":264.0359491046871,"y":-915.404565298055,"z":-50},"area":[],"quest":[{"id":2,"normalizedName":"tour","name":"Tour","type":"main","inAllModes":true,"kappaRequired":false,"lightkeeperRequired":false,"minPlayerLevel":1,"experience":0,"iconLink":3,"publishedAt":"2025-11-29T15:47:11.148Z","taskImageLink":205,"finishRewards":{"items":[],"money":null,"traderStanding":[]},"traderRelation":null,"nextQuests":[],"taskRequirements":{"docs":[],"hasNextPage":false},"events":[],"seasons":[],"updatedAt":"2026-06-15T16:05:38.961Z","createdAt":"2025-11-28T16:10:40.051Z","_status":